<title>INDIA: India Reliance says favours share buyback.</title>
<headline>India Reliance says favours share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Reliance Industries Ltd favours a share buyback, chairman Dhirubhai Ambani told shareholders on Thursday.</p>
<p>He was speaking at the company's annual general meeting.</p>
<p>He did not give details.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22 265 9000</p>
</text>
